*> PLB-C072 unreachable-statement: a statement after EXEC CICS RETURN
*> or XCTL without RESP, RESP2, or NOHANDLE.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. CRET.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  WS-RESP     PIC S9(8) COMP.
01  WS-AREA     PIC X(10).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-PARA.
    *> Reported: the MOVE after RETURN.
    IF WS-AREA = SPACES
        EXEC CICS RETURN TRANSID('ABCD') COMMAREA(WS-AREA) END-EXEC
        MOVE 'X' TO WS-AREA
    END-IF
    *> Not reported: XCTL with RESP comes back when it fails.
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('NEXTPGM') RESP(WS-RESP) END-EXEC
    MOVE 'Y' TO WS-AREA
    *> Reported: the MOVE after XCTL without RESP.
    EXEC CICS XCTL PROGRAM('OTHER') END-EXEC
    MOVE 'Z' TO WS-AREA.
